    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22">

                <pb facs="0126" n="20" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg20"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé White to the
                            Acting Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-07-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 27, 1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 395.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor herewith to inclose a copy
                    of an executive decree of the 21st instant, cut from the Boletin Oficial, No.
                    3817, of the 26th instant, naming a committee of representative men to provide
                    for the reception of the Hon. Elihu Root, Secretary of State of the United
                    States, on the occasion of his visit to this country. I accompany the decree
                    with a translation.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles D. White</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chargé d’ Affaires ad
                    interim.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d22-a1.xml" xpointer="d22-a1"/>
            </div>
